<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html dir="ltr" lang="en"><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><title>Call Notice No. 1: $10,000.00 due Wednesday, January 20, 2027</title></head><body dir="ltr" lang="en" style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0" data-skip-in-text="true">Call Notice No. 1: $10,000.00 due Wednesday, January 20, 2027<div> ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿ ‌​‍﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border="0" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" align="center"><tbody><tr><td dir="ltr" lang="en" style="margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto;margin-bottom:auto;margin-top:auto;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;"><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:560px;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:40px;border-collapse:separate;border-radius:0.25rem;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(229,229,229)"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td style="padding:20px"><h1 style="margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px;padding:0px;text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0,0,0)">Octagon GPU I LLC<!-- --> — <strong>Call Notice No. <!-- -->1</strong></h1><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(82,82,82);margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px">Thursday, January 14, 2027</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px">Dear <!-- -->Jane Doe<!-- -->,</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px">This is a Call Notice under Section 4.9 of the Operating Agreement of <!-- -->Octagon GPU I LLC<!-- -->. The Manager has determined that the following part of the Balance of your Capital Contribution is needed.<!-- --> The amount will pay for the LLC&#x27;s servers.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin-bottom:16px;margin-top:16px"><tbody><tr><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">Capital Contribution committed</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;text-align:right;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">$100,000.00</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">Paid to date</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;text-align:right;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">$60,000.00</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)"><strong>Amount called by this notice</strong></td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;text-align:right;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)"><strong>$30,000.00</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">Already received toward this call</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;text-align:right;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">$20,000.00</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)"><strong>Amount due</strong></td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;text-align:right;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)"><strong>$10,000.00</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">Remaining Balance after this call</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px;text-align:right;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">$30,000.00</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px"><strong>Payment is due by <!-- -->Wednesday, January 20, 2027</strong> (the Balance is due not later than <!-- -->March 31, 2027<!-- --> whether or not a Call Notice has been given).</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin-bottom:16px;margin-top:16px;border-radius:0.25rem;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(229,229,229)"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:12px"><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:0px;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:600;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin-top:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px">Wire instructions</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:45%;padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(82,82,82)">Beneficiary</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">Octagon GPU I LLC</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:45%;padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(82,82,82)">Beneficiary address</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">1 Main Street, Cheyenne, WY 82001</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:45%;padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(82,82,82)">Bank</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">First Bank</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:45%;padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(82,82,82)">Bank address</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">2 Bank Street, Denver, CO 80202</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:45%;padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(82,82,82)">Routing number (ABA)</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">123456789</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:45%;padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(82,82,82)">Account number</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">•••• 6789</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:45%;padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(82,82,82)">Reference</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding-bottom:2px;padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0)">Octagon GPU I LLC CN1 Jane Doe</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px"><strong>Wire instructions will not be changed by email. Before sending funds, confirm these details with the Manager by telephone at a number you already have.</strong></p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px">Preferred Units are issued at one Unit per $1,000 when your payment is received. The Preferred Return on this amount accrues from the later of the due date and the date of receipt.</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px">If the amount due is not received in full by the due date, Section 4.9 of the Operating Agreement applies, including interest at 12% per annum from the due date, suspension of voting rights and distributions while the default continues, and, if not cured within five business days after the due date, forfeiture of 50% of the unpaid Balance (up to the amount you have paid).</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px">Questions: <!-- -->Karl Example<!-- -->, <!-- -->manager@example.com<!-- -->.</p><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:rgb(229,229,229);border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-bottom:26px;margin-top:26px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px"/><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:24px;text-align:center;color:rgb(115,115,115);margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px">Octagon GPU I LLC</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>